</main>

<section class="footer-cta" aria-label="상담 안내">
  <div class="container footer-cta-inner">
    <div>
      <p class="footer-cta-eyebrow">데이터 손실, 골든타임이 중요합니다</p>
      <h2 class="footer-cta-title">전원을 끄고 더 이상 사용하지 마세요.<br class="br-pc"> 전문가가 바로 상담해 드립니다.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-cta-actions">
      <a class="btn btn-white btn-lg" href="tel:<%= CS_TEL %>">☎ <%= CS_TEL %></a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-white btn-lg" href="/data/request">온라인 복구 접수</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-top">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <img src="/resources/images/logo/logo.png" alt="(주)명정보기술" width="130" height="42" class="footer-logo">
        <p class="footer-cs-label">고객센터</p>
        <p class="footer-cs-tel"><a href="tel:<%= CS_TEL %>"><%= CS_TEL %></a></p>
        <p class="footer-cs-hours">평일 24시간 상담 가능 · 주말 09:00 ~ 17:00</p>
        <div class="footer-sns">
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7P1LyBxStJkKxAb_yx5DKw" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="유튜브"><img src="/resources/images/logo_youtube.png" alt="" width="36" height="36"></a>
          <a href="https://blog.naver.com/myungit2" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="네이버 블로그"><img src="/resources/images/logo_blog.png" alt="" width="36" height="36"></a>
          <a href="http://en-myung.co.kr/default/main/main.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="영문 사이트"><img src="/resources/images/logo_naver.png" alt="" width="36" height="36"></a>
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/myung_2121/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="인스타그램"><img src="/resources/images/logo_insta.png" alt="" width="36" height="36"></a>
          <a href="https://band.us/band/64417777" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="밴드"><img src="/resources/images/logo_band.png" alt="" width="36" height="36"></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="footer-menu" aria-label="사이트맵">
<% for (int i = 0; i < SECTIONS.length; i++) { %>
        <div class="footer-menu-col">
          <p class="footer-menu-title"><%= SECTION_LABELS[i] %></p>
          <ul>
<%   for (String[] it : MENU[i]) { %><li><a href="<%= it[1] %>"><%= it[0] %></a></li><% } %>
          </ul>
        </div>
<% } %>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <ul class="footer-links">
        <li><a href="/policy/privacy"><strong>개인정보처리방침</strong></a></li>
        <li><a href="/policy/terms">이용약관</a></li>
        <li><button type="button" class="linklike" data-open-modal="emailModal">이메일무단수집거부</button></li>
        <li><a href="/about/contact">찾아오시는 길</a></li>
      </ul>
      <address class="footer-info">
        <span>상호 : (주)명정보기술</span><span>대표이사 : 이명재</span><span>사업자등록번호 : 315-81-04436</span>
        <span>통신판매신고번호 : 제 2004-충북청원-0002 호 <a href="http://www.ftc.go.kr/info/bizinfo/communicationViewPopup.jsp?wrkr_no=3158104436" target="_blank" rel="noopener">[사업자정보확인]</a></span>
        <span>본사 : 충북 청주시 청원구 오창읍 과학산업3로 168</span><span>Tel : 043-218-8400</span><span>Fax : 043-218-8408</span>
        <span>E-mail : <a href="mailto:cs@myung.co.kr">cs@myung.co.kr</a></span>
